camp.com/),\n   [Apple Music](https://music.apple.com/gb/artist/omoid%C3%A9/1255052605?at=1010lMz4&amp;app=music), [Spotify](https://open.spotify.com/artist/4WK8Uiyh2rcYNK0ktKvBaL), \n   [TrakTrain](https://traktrain.com/omoidee), \n   [Deezer](https://www.deezer.com/en/artist/12745351), \n   [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/omoidayy/), \n   [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/omoideee/), [Twitch](https://www.twitch.tv/omoidayy)\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-03-20T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Omoidé's Takeover","position":0}},{"id":"cvdyx263yxY","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jaylib - Raw Shit (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"vcDFf8Pwo2Y","path":"/artists/jaylib/tracks/raw-shit-instrumental/","slug":"raw-shit-instrumental","title":"Raw Shit (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"jaylib","title":"Jaylib"},"artwork":"images/artists/jaylib/tracks/raw-shit-instrumental.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"fuAWzdYupSQ","slug":"159","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-159-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #159 w/ Daddy Kev","artwork":"/images/episodes/159.jpg","content":"\nKev dropps a 40 minute set that makes you feel like you're in the \"2001&#58; A Space Odyssey\" space hub.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThis week's edition of Soulection Radio was really essential. We had a pioneer and important individual who is responsible for many great things going on in our music culture today. \nHe goes by Daddy Kev which most of you may already be familiar with. He founded the legendary weekly event Low End Theory and co-founded Alpha Pup Records/Distribution. \n\nKev made sure to sprinkle all the classics as well as some forthcoming unreleased material from who knows who. \n\nThings got really interesting when Kev and Joe jumped in to the interview portion during the 2nd hour to discuss everything from experiences at Low End Theory, \nmastering (sound engineering education), the current state of today's music culture, favorite artists to work with, and even a Low End Theory festival that is coming this year. \nDefinitely an educational experience! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"xR9AG5_rRfU","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jaylib - Starz","track":{"id":"V7zRnTgtzdU","path":"/artists/jaylib/tracks/starz/","slug":"starz","title":"Starz","artist":{"slug":"jaylib","title":"Jaylib"},"artwork":"images/artists/jaylib/tracks/starz.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"t26W25WELwY","slug":"190","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-190-w-esta"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #190 w/ Esta","artwork":"/images/episodes/190.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10834,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-10-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"8DYvE4lBA_U","position":29,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jaylib - The Official (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"bYKX9wAGvPo","path":"/artists/jaylib/tracks/the-official-instrumental/","slug":"the-official-instrumental","title":"The Official (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"jaylib","title":"Jaylib"},"artwork":"images/artists/jaylib/tracks/the-official-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"t26W25WELwY","slug":"190","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-190-w-esta"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #190 w/ Esta","artwork":"/images/episodes/190.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.